# API

## 1. Admin

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LOGIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LOGIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": {{$dotenv ADMIN_REMEMBER_ME}}
}

### 1.2 Register / Signup
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTER_PASSWORD}}",
    "firstname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTER_FIRSTNAME}}",
    "lastname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTER_LASTNAME}}"
}

### 1.3 Forgot
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_FORGOT_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9091/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_PASSWORD_TOKEN}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

## 2. User

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_IDENTIFIER}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2 Register / Signup
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_USERNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_PASSWORD}}"
}


### 2.3 Forgot
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_FORGOT_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_PASSWORD_CODE}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_PASSWORD}}",
    "passwordConfirmation": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_PASSWORD_CONFIRMATION}}"
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

## 3.Content

### 3.1 Student

### 3.1.1 Create4POST http://localhost:9091/api/students
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_NAME}}",
    "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_MOBILE}}",
    "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_CARD_ID}}"
  }
}

### 3.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9091/api/students/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/students/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_NAME}}",
    "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_MOBILE}}",
    "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_CARD_ID}}"
  }
}

### 3.1.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/students/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.2 Subject

### 3.2.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9091/api/subjects
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv SUBJECT_CREATE_NAME}}"
  }
}

### 3.2.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9091/api/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.2.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/{{$dotenv SUBJECT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.2.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/{{$dotenv SUBJECT_ID}}
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv SUBJECT_UPDATE_NAME}}"
  }
}

### 3.2.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/subjects/{{$dotenv SUBJECT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.3 Teacher

### 3.3.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9091/api/teachers
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv TEACHER_CREATE_NAME}}"
  }
}

### 3.3.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9091/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.3.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{$dotenv TEACHER_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

### 3.3.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{$dotenv TEACHER_ID}}
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv TEACHER_UPDATE_NAME}}"
  }
}

### 3.3.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{$dotenv TEACHER_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_PROFILE_TOKEN}}